        <mxCell id="7OVz4w7n9kzEPWy-4BBC-14" value="&lt;span&gt;The AWS API gateway forward the client requests to the lambda function composed by the following services:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br&gt;- POST: /init/{client_id} - Response: conversation_id.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;- PUT: /ask/{conversation_id} - Body: {text: ...}&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;- PUT: /talk/{conversation_id} - Body: {audio: ...}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;- PUT: /close/{conversation_id}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
